42
00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:44.820
How do you know?

43
00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:47.510
Like, or just was it like this was just fun

44
00:01:47.510 --> 00:01:49.470
and you wanted to do it?

45
00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:51.530
Well, it was just fun and I wanted to do it,

46
00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:53.770
but I also, you know you can kind of tell

47
00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:56.450
