52
00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.640
I mean, he's almost six

53
00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:07.610
but he is just, you know, a little guy.

54
00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:10.430 line:15%
So I don't know if he'll have that

55
00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:13.000 line:15%
