56
00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.440 line:15%
We're supportive of whatever he wants to do,

57
00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:18.650 line:15%
but he definitely has pitch.

58
00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:22.200 line:15%
