85
00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:35.060
and cute and charming and wanna participate,

86
00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:38.523
some days, you know, they're not in that mood.

87
00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:44.470
It's exciting when they're in your world,

88
00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:47.250
you can enjoy it, things are flowing.

89
00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:51.400
It's like, these are these moments I cherish so much.

90
00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.320
Can't get them back, that's for sure.

91
00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.500
That sounds just like my favorite line

92
00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.260
in "Planes, Trains and Automobiles"

93
00:03:57.260 --> 00:03:58.930
